OL,3,GNEWSACouncil reorganisation a mad hokey
OL,4,Acokey, says leader
OL,5,
OL,6,FA government department has admitted
OL,7,Fmistakes in the latest round of local
OL,8,Fgovernment reorganisation.
OL,10,FLeaders in Oxfordshire and West
OL,11,FBerkshire received a "minded-to"
OL,12,Fdecision letter in October confirming
OL,13,Fthe proposals for the three unitary
OL,14,Fauthorities the government intended to
OL,15,Fproceed with.
OL,17,FBut an "inconsistency" in the
OL,18,Fdescription of the Greater Oxford
OL,19,Fboundary led to confusion over which
OL,20,Fparishes were to be included.
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
