OL,3,GNEWSACouncil reorganisation a mad hokey
OL,4,Acokey, says leader
OL,5,
OL,6,FLiberal Democrat leader of Oxfordshire
OL,7,FCounty Council, Tim Bearder, called it
OL,8,F"a mad hokey cokey." A spokesperson for
OL,9,Fthe Ministry of Housing, Communities
OL,10,Fand Local Government (MHCLG) said it
OL,11,F"remained committed" to the plans.
